Dear Gon?alo,

Are you having a problem with line-width? If so, measure the peak-width of the singlet of interest or in a representative signal in a couple of your spectra and then tweak more stringently the global and random effect peak width priors (mu, nu_m) in the BatmanOptions.txt file. 
 
Best Regards,
Gon?alo
